{% comment %}
  11FIT SEO Rich Content Section for Collection Pages
  Optimized for Google Search, Google Shopping & AI Overviews (ChatGPT, Perplexity, Gemini)
  Provides 350+ words of semantic text, high-intent transactional keyword anchors, and internal link funnels
{% endcomment %}

<div class="fit11-seo-content-section page-width" style="padding: 40px 20px 60px; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;">
  <div class="fit11-seo-card" style="background: #fdfdfd; border: 1.5px solid #ececec; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px 32px; box-shadow: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.02);">
    
    {%- assign c_title = collection.title | default: "Activewear & Gym Apparel" -%}
    {%- assign c_handle = collection.handle | default: "all" -%}

    <div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #f0f0f0; padding-bottom: 12px;">
      <h2 style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: #111827; margin: 0; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;">
        <span style="color: #c5a059;">★</span>
        {% if c_handle contains 'short' %}
          Men's Gym Shorts, Workout Shorts &amp; Athletic Training Shorts with Zipper Pockets | 11FIT India
        {% elsif c_handle contains 'track' or c_handle contains 'pant' or c_handle contains 'lower' %}
          Men's Athletic Track Pants, Gym Lowers &amp; 4-Way Lycra Joggers | 11FIT India
        {% elsif c_handle contains 'top' or c_handle contains 'crop' or c_handle contains 'girl' or c_handle contains 'baby-tee' %}
          Aesthetic Y2K Graphic Baby Tees &amp; Bio-Washed Crop Tops for Girls | 11FIT India
        {% elsif c_handle contains 't-shirt' or c_handle contains 'tee' or c_handle contains 'regular' or c_handle contains 'oversized' %}
          Men's Classic Fit T-Shirts &amp; Heavyweight Oversized Graphic Tees | 11FIT India
        {% else %}
          Premium Men's Activewear &amp; Everyday Streetwear by 11FIT India
        {% endif %}
      </h2>
      <span style="font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1px; color: #6b7280; background: #f3f4f6; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 20px;">
        11FIT Buying Guide
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="fit11-seo-text-wrap" id="fit11SeoTextWrap" style="position: relative; max-height: 160px; overflow: hidden; transition: max-height 0.4s ease; color: #4b5563; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.75;">
      
      {% if c_handle contains 'short' %}
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
          Looking for the <strong>best gym shorts for men in India</strong> that can endure heavy squats, high-intensity interval training (HIIT), and long-distance running? <strong>11FIT Workout Shorts</strong> are engineered specifically for athletes and fitness enthusiasts who refuse to compromise on mobility, durability, or functionality.
        </p>
        <p>
          Traditional athletic shorts often suffer from sweat retention, heavy bunching, and insecure shallow pockets where smartphones slip out during bench presses. 11FIT solves this with our dual flagship innovations:
        </p>
        <ul style="margin: 12px 0 16px 20px; padding: 0;">
          <li><strong><a href="/products/11-fit-ns-terry-lycra-30-active-shorts" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">11FIT NS Terry Lycra Active Shorts</a>:</strong> Built with 30% Lycra blend and French terry loop backing. Moisture-repellent outer micro-weave combined with quick-dry inner loops prevents painful thigh chafing during intense leg workouts.</li>
          <li><strong><a href="/products/11-fit-air-flex-4-way-lycra-active-shorts" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">11FIT Air Flex 4-Way Lycra Shorts</a>:</strong> Featherlight four-way hyper-stretch fabric offering 360-degree range of motion for deep squats, weightlifting, sprints, and outdoor sports.</li>
          <li><strong>Deep Anti-Slip Zipper Pockets:</strong> Ergonomically angled concealed zipper pockets designed to lock modern 6.7-inch smartphones, gym keys, and earbuds securely against your hip without annoying bounce.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
          Discover why thousands of lifters choose 11FIT in our <a href="/blogs/journal/best-gym-shorts-for-men-india-4-way-lycra-zipper-pockets-guide" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Men's Gym Shorts Buying Guide</a> and our in-depth comparison on <a href="/blogs/journal/lycra-vs-cotton-vs-dry-fit-best-gym-wear-fabric-indian-weather" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Lycra vs Cotton Activewear Fabric</a>. Take advantage of our bestselling <strong>3 Gym Shorts @ ₹899 Combo Pack</strong> with <strong>Cash on Delivery (COD)</strong>, <strong>Free Express Shipping across India</strong>, and a hassle-free 7-day doorstep size exchange policy.
        </p>

      {% elsif c_handle contains 'track' or c_handle contains 'pant' or c_handle contains 'lower' %}
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
          Upgrade your workout wardrobe and streetwear rotation with <strong>11FIT Men's Track Pants and Gym Lowers</strong>. Precision-tailored in Rohtak, Haryana, our athletic trackpants deliver the perfect balance of an athletic tapered taper, squat-proof flexibility, and breathable all-day comfort.
        </p>
        <p>
          Crafted from high-recovery <strong>4-way stretch Lycra and NS micro-poly fabric</strong>, our track pants resist knee-bagging, wrinkles, and color fading wash after wash. Equipped with high-grade concealed zip pockets, durable elasticated drawstrings, and ankle zip cuffs, they easily transition from rigorous gym sessions to travel and airport fashion.
        </p>
        <p>
          Read our comprehensive guide on <a href="/blogs/journal/ultimate-guide-mens-track-pants-lowers-india-lycra-ns-fabric" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Men's Track Pants &amp; Lowers Fabrics</a>, or pair them with our bestselling <a href="/collections/shorts" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Men's Gym Shorts</a> and graphic tees. Fast 2–4 business days delivery across Delhi NCR, Mumbai, Bangalore, Kolkata, and nationwide COD available.
        </p>

      {% elsif c_handle contains 't-shirt' or c_handle contains 'tee' or c_handle contains 'regular' or c_handle contains 'oversized' %}
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
          Discover the definitive collection of <strong>Men's Classic Fit T-Shirts &amp; Heavyweight Oversized Graphic Tees</strong> by 11FIT India. Made from 100% super-combed, bio-washed cotton, each t-shirt delivers a silky-smooth, pill-free hand feel that stays breathable in warm and humid Indian weather.
        </p>
        <p>
          Whether you prefer our <a href="/products/classic-fit-regular-tshirts" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Classic Fit Regular T-Shirt for Men</a> for clean daily styling and gym training, or our 240 GSM drop-shoulder streetwear oversized tees (<a href="/products/11fit-savage-tee" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Savage Graphic Tee</a>, <a href="/products/stay-real-unisex-crew-neck-t-shirt" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Stay Real Unisex Tee</a>), our garments undergo rigorous pre-shrunk testing to ensure zero shrinkage after washing.
        </p>
        <p>
          Read our guide on <a href="/blogs/journal/bio-washed-cotton-vs-regular-cotton-clothing-guide" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Bio-Washed Cotton vs Regular Cotton</a> and explore our <a href="/blogs/journal/oversized-streetwear-t-shirts-india-gsm-fit-guide" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Oversized T-Shirt GSM &amp; Fit Guide</a>. Enjoy multibuy bundle discounts, instant UPI cashback, and verified Cash on Delivery across India.
        </p>

      {% elsif c_handle contains 'top' or c_handle contains 'crop' or c_handle contains 'girl' or c_handle contains 'baby-tee' %}
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
          Step into trending <strong>Y2K streetwear and aesthetic collegiate fashion</strong> with <strong>11FIT Graphic Baby Tees, Crop Tops &amp; Ribbed Tanks</strong>. Designed for the modern Indian girl, our collection blends 90s vintage nostalgia with ultra-soft 100% combed cotton comfort.
        </p>
        <p>
          From dainty pastel pink ribbon bow graphics to playful anime chibi prints and snug ribbed cotton crop tank tops, each piece is designed for effortless pairing with high-waisted denim jeans, parachute cargos, or athletic gym shorts. Learn how to style them with our <a href="/blogs/journal/ultimate-guide-aesthetic-crop-tops-baby-tees-girls-india" style="color: #c5a059; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: underline;">Aesthetic Crop Tops &amp; Baby Tees Styling Guide</a>. Available with Buy 2 / Buy 3 multibuy combo savings and 100% Cash on Delivery across India.
        </p>

      {% else %}
        <p style="margin-top: 0;">
          <strong>11FIT (Espon Clothing Pvt. Ltd.)</strong> is India's premier direct-to-consumer sportswear and streetwear label. Manufactured with pride in Rohtak, Haryana, we engineer gym shorts with zipper pockets, 4-way lycra trackpants, classic fit cotton tees, and aesthetic streetwear without inflated retail markups.
        </p>
        <p>
          Every garment is tested for squat-proof durability, skin-friendly softness, and vibrant color fastness wash after wash. Backed by hassle-free 7-day doorstep size exchanges, express courier tracking via Delhivery and Blue Dart, and Pan-India Cash on Delivery, elevate your athletic lifestyle with 11FIT.
        </p>
      {% endif %}

      <!-- Fade Gradient Overlay for Collapsed State -->
      <div id="fit11SeoFade" style="position: absolute; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0; height: 60px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(253, 253, 253, 0), #fdfdfd); pointer-events: none;"></div>
    </div>

    <div style="margin-top: 12px; text-align: center;">
      <button type="button" id="fit11SeoToggleBtn" onclick="fit11ToggleSeoContent()" style="background: none; border: 1.5px solid #c5a059; color: #c5a059; padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 20px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; transition: all 0.2s;">
        <span id="fit11SeoBtnText">Read Full Buying Guide</span>
        <span id="fit11SeoBtnArrow" style="font-size: 14px;">↓</span>
      </button>
    </div>

  </div>
</div>

<script>
  function fit11ToggleSeoContent() {
    var wrap = document.getElementById('fit11SeoTextWrap');
    var fade = document.getElementById('fit11SeoFade');
    var btnText = document.getElementById('fit11SeoBtnText');
    var btnArrow = document.getElementById('fit11SeoBtnArrow');
    
    if (wrap.style.maxHeight === 'none' || wrap.style.maxHeight === '2000px') {
      wrap.style.maxHeight = '160px';
      fade.style.display = 'block';
      btnText.innerText = 'Read Full Buying Guide';
      btnArrow.innerText = '↓';
    } else {
      wrap.style.maxHeight = '2000px';
      fade.style.display = 'none';
      btnText.innerText = 'Show Less';
      btnArrow.innerText = '↑';
    }
  }
</script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "11FIT SEO Content Block",
  "settings": [],
  "presets": [
    {
      "name": "11FIT SEO Content Block"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
